ar"],[1748,"**Root cause (two layers):**"],[1756,"**Root cause (verified against PO-UI source):**"],[1707,"**Root cause:**"],[1867,"**Root cause:** `p-selected-rows` não é um output de `po-table`. Os outputs corretos são eventos por linha."],[1714,"**Root cause:** `po-decimal` não aplica `text-align: right` via CSS interno (v17.26.28)."],[1694,"**Root cause:** `po-input` renders a wrapper that includes an invisible 8px space below\nthe visible input field, reserved for validation error messages. `flex-end` aligns to the\nbottom of this wrapper (including the invisible 8px), not to the bottom of the visible field."],[1777,"**Root cause:** `po-table` handles row expansion entirely internally. When the user clicks\nthe expand chevron, `po-table` toggles its internal `showDetails` flag and updates its own\nview — but it does **not** call `markForCheck()` on the parent component. With\n`ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush`, the parent component's CD cycle never fires, so Angular\nnever re-renders the projected detail content."],[1699,"**Root cause:** `PoDynamicFormBaseComponent` declares only one `@Output`: `outputs: \\{ formOutput: \"p-form\" \\}`.\nThere is no `p-value-change` output. Angular silently ignores unknown event bindings — no error, no warning."],[1882,"**Root cause:** `PoTableDetail.columns` usa o tipo interno `PoTableDetailColumn`, subconjunto de\n`PoTableColumn` que &#x2A;*não inclui `width`**. `width` só é válido em colunas master."],[1772,"**Root cause:** Angular's signal auto-unwrapping only works in **Angular-owned template\ncontexts** (built-in directives, Angular's own components with the same signal runtime).\nPO-UI components read `@Input()` values imperatively via `this.breadcrumb.items` inside\ntheir own lifecycle hooks — they receive the Signal function object itself if `()` was omitted."],[1885,"**Root cause:** Colunas sem `type` específico são renderizadas como `string` — sem alinhamento nem formatação automática."],[1837,"**Root cause:** po-table